* SETEXIT FACE 5 -- A HANDLER THAT RE-ARMS ITSELF CATCHES THE NEXT ERROR TOO.
* The companion to se_oneshot: same program, one added SETEXIT inside the handler.
	SETEXIT(.H)
	&ERRLIMIT = 10
	D = 0
	X = 1 / D		:F(S5)
S5	OUTPUT = "MID"
	Y = 1 / D		:F(S7)
S7	OUTPUT = "AFTER"
	:(END)
H	OUTPUT = "HANDLER S" &LASTNO
	SETEXIT(.H)
	:(CONTINUE)
END
